  "content": "<p>透過設定檔與兩種配方類型新增多種額外苦力怕變種<br><br>當它們爆炸時，若附近存在石頭方塊（可配置），這些方塊將被注入礦石</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>首先佈置陷阱</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>接著在陷阱中放置物品</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>當陷阱轉化苦力怕後，讓它在特定方塊（如普通石頭）周圍爆炸，將其轉化為礦石方塊</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>查看範例設定檔與兩種JSON配方格式請點<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LqDnGJr.gif\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/LqDnGJr.gif\" width=\"850\" height=\"496\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>另一範例：青金石苦力怕爆炸效果</p><p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fQyCtWtW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW.gif\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/QyCtWtW.gif\" width=\"850\" height=\"496\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;-</p><p>基於<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a>與FLIB架構開發 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;若要為模組包自訂內容，可建立原版資料包，和/或使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker</a> 範例請見<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Lothrazar/VeinCreeper/tree/trunk/1.20/examples</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\">r</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
